        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"53969230-6045-4b20-8a96-120ef4a281a7\",\"review_text\":\"I love this app for me it works well ☺️\"},{\"review_id\":\"24dca702-5bde-426b-aeb4-351ba311ce73\",\"review_text\":\"Ooo\"},{\"review_id\":\"d6d82243-1a49-4dda-86be-a41907fcf67a\",\"review_text\":\"It works really well. I mean i feel like we should get unlimited skips but its okay\"},{\"review_id\":\"d4503a81-4593-4108-a1ae-71c068e52941\",\"review_text\":\"Suddenly the app stopped working...taking more than a minute to open and then if we play any song, it just crashes or hangs in there without playing.\"},{\"review_id\":\"2dd0985f-25bf-4db8-aa25-f4f904f27080\",\"review_text\":\"I'm trying to access the Canvas feature on Spotify for a while now, but to no avail as the option to access Spotify Canvas doesn't appear under the settings for me. I've updated the app as much as possible, and my Spotify version is listed as version 8.7.52.1010. This is quite disappointing to me, as I had high expectations to use the feature. It'd be greatly appreciated if I was helped with this issue, and if it could be resolved.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c4b4dd15-542a-477e-92b4-bf52cf5ab6c8\",\"review_text\":\"Kitna paisa kamayega bhai kuch to free rehne de hum jaiso ke liye\"},{\"review_id\":\"6d1c29a2-8da5-428a-a822-bae723d242f5\",\"review_text\":\"It doesn't play the songs you want to play it shuffles them with other songs\"},{\"review_id\":\"3fa62818-f8aa-46d8-8cf0-c9fd881e8725\",\"review_text\":\"Bro this is the best app to listen to music it's the best for you listening to the best music 👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"a374bae9-a963-4612-8dd7-46941f6fc71d\",\"review_text\":\"Enjoy the veriety of music\"},{\"review_id\":\"bfaf49ba-b012-43cf-9fb4-b31f657ae04f\",\"review_text\":\"Awesome i love it(always wish for something like that\"}]}"
